<h1 class="product_title entry-title wd-entities-title">
	
	Itel 4KW Pro IP54 Hybrid Inverter
	</h1>
<p class="price"><span class="woocommerce-Price-amount amount"><bdi><span class="woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol" translate="no" dir="auto">₨</span>110,000.00</bdi></span></p>
<div class="hajvery-automated-price-box"><div class="hajvery-price-box-header"><div class="hajvery-price-box-title">Available Pricing</div><div class="hajvery-price-stock hajvery-stock-in">In Stock</div></div><div class="hajvery-price-row"><span class="hajvery-price-label">Per Product</span><span class="hajvery-price-value"><span class="woocommerce-Price-amount amount"><span class="woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol" dir="auto">₨</span>110,000.00</span></span></div><div class="hajvery-price-last-updated">Last updated: 2026-09-08 13:36:42</div></div><div class="woocommerce-product-details__short-description">
	<p><span style="font-weight: 400">The </span><b>itel 4KW Pro Hybrid Inverter</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> is a single-phase </span><b>24V low-voltage hybrid inverter</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> designed for solar PV, battery storage, grid supply and backup loads. With up to </span><b>6000W PV input</b><span style="font-weight: 400">, a </span><b>120A maximum MPPT charging current</b><span style="font-weight: 400">, lithium-ion and lead-acid battery support, and dual-output capability for smart and main loads, it is suitable for homes and small backup systems. The inverter also provides </span><b>IP54 protection</b><span style="font-weight: 400">, diesel generator support and smart load support, making it a practical option for users looking for a </span><b>4kW hybrid inverter</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> for solar self-consumption and load-shedding backup.</span></p>
<h3><b>Quick Highlights</b></h3>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Rated Output:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> 4000W</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Phase:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> Single Phase</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Battery Type/Voltage:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> Lead-acid / Lithium-ion / User Defined, 24V</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Max PV Input:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> 6000W</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>MPPTs:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> 1</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Backup/EPS:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> 4000W output with 10ms UPS switching / 20ms appliance switching</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Protection Rating:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> IP54</span></li>
<li><strong>Warranty:</strong> 3-Year Replacement Warranty + 5-Year Service Warranty</li>
</ul>
</div>
