<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Battery Voltage Range:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> 20V–30V</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Maximum MPPT Charging Current:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> 120A</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Maximum Mains/Generator Charging Current:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> 10A</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Maximum Discharging Current:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> 160A</span></li>
</ul>
<h3><b>AC/Grid Input</b></h3>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Maximum Grid Input Voltage:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> 380Vac</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Nominal Voltage:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> 230Vac</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Input Voltage Range:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> 90–280Vac</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Maximum AC Input Current:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> 28A in bypass mode</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Nominal Operating Frequency:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> 50Hz/60Hz</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>THDi:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> &lt;3%</span></li>
</ul>
<h3><b>AC Output</b></h3>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Nominal AC Output Power:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> 4000W</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Maximum Apparent Power:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> 4000VA</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Nominal AC Output Voltage:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> 220V / 230V / 240V</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Total Voltage Harmonic Distortion:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> &lt;3%</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Nominal AC Frequency:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> 50Hz</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Switching Time:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> 10ms UPS / 20ms appliances</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Surge Power:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> 8000W for 5 seconds</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Overload Capacity:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> 105–150% for 10 seconds; 150–200% for 5 seconds</span></li>
</ul>
<h3><b>General Specifications</b></h3>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Dimensions:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> 120 × 347 × 445 mm</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Net Weight:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> 9.2 kg</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Operating Temperature:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> -10°C to +55°C</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Power Derating:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> Above 45°C</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Maximum Operating Altitude:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> 4000m</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Communication:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> Wi-Fi / RS485 / RS232 / Dry Contact</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Diesel Generator Support:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> Yes</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Smart Load Support:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> Yes</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Parallel Operation:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> No</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Cooling Method:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> Intelligent Fan Cooling</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Noise:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> &lt;60dB</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Ingress Protection:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> IP54</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Overvoltage Protection:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> Yes</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Overload Protection:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> Yes</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Short Circuit Protection:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> Yes</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Over Temperature Protection:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> Yes</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Surge Protection:</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> DC Type II / AC Type II</span></li>
</ul>
<h2><b>itel 4KW Pro Hybrid Inverter Efficiency</b></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">The inverter provides </span><b>MPPT tracking efficiency of ≥99.9%</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> and </span><b>maximum battery-mode conversion efficiency of ≥93%</b><span style="font-weight: 400">.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">For a solar system, high MPPT tracking efficiency helps the inverter follow available PV power effectively. Actual energy yield will still depend on solar irradiation, panel configuration, temperature, wiring losses, battery condition and system loading.</span></p>
<h2><b>Recommended Solar System Size</b></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">The inverter has a </span><b>4000W rated AC output</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> but permits up to </span><b>6000W of PV input</b><span style="font-weight: 400">. These are two different ratings and should not be treated as the same figure.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">A solar array can be designed up to the inverter’s stated PV input limit, but the final configuration must also respect:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Maximum PV voltage</b></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>PV string Voc</b></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>PV input current</b></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>MPPT voltage range</b></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Panel temperature correction</b></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><b>Local installation conditions</b></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">The </span><b>itel 4kw pro inverter datasheet</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> search intent is particularly relevant for buyers and installers who want to check these limits before finalising the PV string configuration.</span></p>
<h2><b>Hybrid Inverter Use in Pakistan</b></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">A </span><b>4kW hybrid inverter</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> can be useful in Pakistan where households want to combine daytime solar generation with battery backup and grid power.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">During the day, solar energy can supply connected loads while surplus available energy can be used for battery charging. During a grid interruption, the backup output can supply selected loads from the battery, subject to battery capacity and inverter limits.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">The </span><b>24V battery architecture</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> should be considered carefully because battery current becomes important at higher loads. Battery sizing, cable selection, DC protection and proper installation are especially important for a 4kW low-voltage hybrid system.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">The inverter should also be installed in a properly ventilated location. Its operating temperature range extends from </span><b>-10°C to +55°C</b><span style="font-weight: 400">, with power derating above </span><b>45°C</b><span style="font-weight: 400">, so heat management is important in Pakistan’s hot summer conditions.</span></p>
<h2><b>itel 4KW Pro Hybrid Inverter Price in Pakistan</b></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">The </span><b>itel 4kw price in pakistan</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> is an important consideration for buyers comparing 4kW hybrid solar solutions.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">The current price of the </span><b>itel 4KW Pro Hybrid Inverter</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> in Pakistan is </span><b>Rs. 110,000.00</b><span style="font-weight: 400">.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">For customers searching </span><b>itel 4kw price</b><span style="font-weight: 400">, </span><b>itel 4kw inverter price in pakistan</b><span style="font-weight: 400">, </span><b>itel inverter 4kw price in pakistan</b><span style="font-weight: 400">, </span><b>itel 4kw inverter price in pakistan olx</b><span style="font-weight: 400"> or </span><b>itel solar inverter 4kw price in pakistan</b><span style="font-weight: 400">, the important point is to check the exact model and current seller price rather than assuming that every 4kW itel inverter has the same price.</span></p>
